{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-398",
  "title": "YC",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "YC"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*Channeling YC partner mode: Direct, data-focused, pragmatic*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🎯 **Quick Take**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Interesting? Yes.** AI-powered animation tools + \"Cursor for designers\" positioning = timely market thesis."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Ready for YC today? Need more information.** Let me ask the hard questions first."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🔍 **The Critical Questions** (YC would hammer you on these)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Traction - Do you have users yet?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How many people have used this?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Any paying customers? (Even $1 counts)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Growth rate? (Week-over-week numbers)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If no users: Why not? What's blocking launch?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Who is this for?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Designers\" is too broad (which designers? doing what?)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Motion graphics pros? (They use After Effects/Cinema 4D)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Web devs who can't animate? (Different pain point)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Marketing teams making social content? (Canva competitor?)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**YC will ask: \"Who are the 10 people who desperately need this RIGHT NOW?\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Why you? Why now?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What's your unfair advantage here?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Are you a designer who codes? Developer who animates? Both?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Why hasn't this been built before? (After Effects exists, Figma has motion, Rive exists)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What changed that makes this the right time?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **The AI angle - Is it core or feature?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Cursor for designers\" is catchy, but is AI the product or a nice-to-have?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Could this succeed WITHOUT the AI? (If yes, maybe AI isn't the moat)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Can you show me 3 animations that are **impossible** to make without your AI?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💪 **What's Strong** (YC would like this)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **Timely Positioning**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"Cursor for X\" is a proven framing (investors get it immediately)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "AI coding tools are hot; AI design tools are next"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Multiplayer/collab is table stakes now (you're building it)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **Technical Execution**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "GSAP is production-grade (used by Apple, Google, etc.)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "InstantDB for multiplayer = smart choice (fast to ship)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Direct GSAP playback (60fps) = you care about performance"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Already has: timeline, keyframes, properties panel, AI agent"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "✅ **Scope Understanding**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "101-task roadmap shows you've thought deeply about this"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-47",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Animation-specific (not trying to be Figma 2.0)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Web-native (easier distribution than native apps)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🚩 **What's Concerning** (YC would drill here)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "❌ **Market Confusion**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Who loses if you win?**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "After Effects? (Unlikely - pros won't switch)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Rive/Lottie? (Different use case - they export to apps)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Canva? (Broader tool, not dev-focused)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Framer Motion devs? (Hand-coding animations)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**YC wants a clear enemy.** \"We're killing [X] for [Y audience]\" — what's yours?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "❌ **Missing Traction Data**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I can't find evidence of:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User testimonials (\"This saved me 10 hours!\")"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-63",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Growth metrics (even if it's 5 users growing to 10)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-64",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Revenue (even a $29 landing page payment)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**YC red flag:** Building in isolation without user feedback."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "❌ **Incomplete \"Minimum\" Viable Product**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your roadmap shows:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "✅ Core editor works (timeline, keyframes, AI agent)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-70",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "❌ No undo/redo (critical for creative tools)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-71",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "❌ No groups (hard to make complex animations)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-72",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "❌ No shape drawing tools (surprising for a design tool)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**YC question:** \"Why haven't you launched yet? What's the actual blocker?\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "❌ **Unclear Business Model**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-76",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SaaS subscription? ($X/month?)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-77",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Freemium with paid export?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-78",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "One-time purchase?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-79",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Developer tool (free, monetize later)?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**YC cares less about pricing perfection, more about ANY revenue signal.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🎯 **What YC Would Want to See**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Before applying:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **10 people using this weekly** (even if it's buggy)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Motion designers? Web devs? Marketing teams?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Get specific testimonials: \"I used LILA to ship [X] in [Y hours]\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **One core workflow that's 10x better**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-89",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Example: \"Turn Figma mockup into scroll animation in 2 minutes\" (vs. 2 hours hand-coding)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Demo this OBSESSIVELY"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Evidence you talk to users**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Video of user sessions (watching them struggle = gold)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Quotes: \"I tried [competitor] but it couldn't do [X]\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-94",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Churn analysis (if anyone's churned, why?)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-95",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Founder story**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-96",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Why this problem? (Did you waste 100 hours animating something?)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-97",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Why you? (Designer + dev? Worked at Figma/Adobe? Self-taught animator?)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-98",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Scrappy revenue attempt**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-99",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Even a \"Pay what you want\" button → did anyone pay?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-100",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pre-orders for early access?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-101",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-102",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Strategic Recommendations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Option A: **Target Web Devs** (Easier GTM)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Thesis:** Devs who need to ship slick animations but suck at GSAP."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Why this works:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-110",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-106",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Devs have money (SaaS budgets)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-107",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Distribution = Product Hunt, GitHub, dev Twitter"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-108",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Comparison: \"Cursor for GSAP\" (very clear)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-109",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Lower bar: They'll tolerate bugs if it saves time"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-111",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
